                        tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="section-header-content"><div class="section-header-text"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h3>Nintendo on your smart device</h3><p>Play games, get the latest news, manage your account, and more, right on your smart device with these handy apps. </p></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
                    tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="rich-text-block-text tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-8 lg:tw-col-start-3"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><p></p><hr/><p></p></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-05 spacing-bottom-layout-05"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
                    tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="rich-text-block-image-left rich-text-block-image-mobile-top
            tw-flex tw-items-center
            tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6
            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Nintendo Switch™ App</h4><p>With this app, you can access game-specific services, view your online friends, and use voice chat during online play—all of which allow you to get even more out of online play. A Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) is required to use certain features.</p><!--$--><section class="cta-block   spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center"><a href="/au/apps/nintendo-switch-app/" class="btn btn-skin-primary btn-size-md ">Learn More</a></div></section><!--/$--><p></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Apps - Nintendo Switch App - Image" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1744342057/jswf2yagizk6qw3zkchf);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_scale,dpr_1.5,w_720/v1744342057/jswf2yagizk6qw3zkchf"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-05 spacing-bottom-layout-05"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
                    tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="rich-text-block-image-left rich-text-block-image-mobile-top
            tw-flex tw-items-center
            tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6
            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Nintendo Today!</h4><p>Get updates on all things Nintendo! Whether it&#x27;s news about the Nintendo Switch™ 2 system and video games, info about your favourite characters, or videos and comic strips—you&#x27;ll get personalised fun every day. </p><!--$--><section class="cta-block   spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center"><a href="/au/apps/nintendo-today/" class="btn btn-skin-primary btn-size-md ">Learn more</a></div></section><!--/$--><p><br/></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Apps - Nintendo Today! - Image" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1744342058/voyq8jzixrcflxfwbs33);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_scale,dpr_1.5,w_720/v1744342058/voyq8jzixrcflxfwbs33"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-05 spacing-bottom-layout-05"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
                    tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="rich-text-block-image-left rich-text-block-image-mobile-top
            tw-flex tw-items-center
            tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6
            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Nintendo Music™</h4><p>Listen to Nintendo soundtracks on your smart device with this exclusive app for Nintendo Switch Online members.</p><!--$--><section class="cta-block   spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center"><a href="/au/games/mobile/nintendo-music/" class="btn btn-skin-primary btn-size-md ">Learn more</a></div></section><!--/$--><p></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Nintendo Music Hero" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1749788644/clbdebz07lmz7yvep9lj);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_scale,dpr_1.5,w_720/v1749788644/clbdebz07lmz7yvep9lj"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-05 spacing-bottom-layout-05"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
                    tw-grid tw-rounded-[4px] tw-grid-cols-12 tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6 "><div class="rich-text-block-image-left rich-text-block-image-mobile-top
            tw-flex tw-items-center
            tw-gap-4 md:tw-gap-6
            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Nintendo Switch™ Parental Controls</h4><p>Nintendo Switch Parental Controls is a free app for smart devices to keep you engaged with your family&#x27;s gaming activities on Nintendo Switch. Limit play time, see what games are being played, and more.</p><!--$--><section class="cta-block   spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center"><a href="/au/apps/parental-controls/" class="btn btn-skin-primary btn-size-md ">Learn more</a></div></section><!--/$--><p></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Apps - Nintendo Switch Parental Controls - Image" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405.9" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1744342059/qta5qritcg544rgbs2xx);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_scale,dpr_1.5,w_720/v1744342059/qta5qritcg544rgbs2xx"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
