            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Hello, Mario!</h4><p>Ready to play? With this free application, together you and your child can play with Mario’s face and delight in his many expressions!</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><a href="https://apps.apple.com/au/app/hello-mario/id6746391951" class="" target="_blank" rel="norefferer noopener nofollow"><picture><img alt="Apple App Store" loading="lazy" width="200" height="59" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-auto tw-mx-auto" style="color:transparent;width:200px;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1730433650/ginq3co8zn6ti4621vzj);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/v1730433650/ginq3co8zn6ti4621vzj"/></picture></a></p></td><td><p><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nintendo.zata" class="" target="_blank" rel="norefferer noopener nofollow"><picture><img alt="Google Play Store" loading="lazy" width="200" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-auto tw-mx-auto" style="color:transparent;width:200px;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1730433620/wwzqah3xkxkhccpmrynv);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/v1730433620/wwzqah3xkxkhccpmrynv"/></picture></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Apps - Hello, Mario! Banner" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/