            tw-col-span-12 lg:tw-col-span-10 lg:tw-col-start-2"><div class="rich-text-block-text md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="rich-text-spacing   theme-text"><h4>Fire Emblem™ Heroes</h4><p>Fight battles customised for touch screens and on-the-go play and summon characters from across the Fire Emblem universe.</p><!--$--><section class="cta-block   spacing-top-layout-01 spacing-bottom-layout-01"><div class="container  tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center"><a href="/au/games/mobile/fire-emblem-heroes/" class="btn btn-skin-primary btn-size-md ">Learn more</a></div></section><!--/$--><p></p></div></div><div class="rich-text-block-img md:tw-w-[50%]"><div class="aspect-ratio-box no-ratio "><figure><picture><img alt="Apps - Fire Emblem Heroes - Image" loading="lazy" width="720" height="405" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw-bg-center tw-bg-no-repeat tw-w-full" style="color:transparent;background-image:url(https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_limit,e_blur:100,f_auto,q_auto,w_16/v1744342065/azn3qzoopyf4ftrnwzw4);background-size:cover" src="https://assets.nintendo.com.au/image/private/f_auto/q_auto/c_scale,dpr_1.5,w_720/v1744342065/azn3qzoopyf4ftrnwzw4"/></picture></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><script>$RC("B:4","S:4")</script><div hidden id="S:5"><section class="rich-text-block  spacing-top-layout-05 spacing-bottom-layout-05"><div class="container  "><div class="rich-text-block-container 
